# The same call in a window too short for its choices: all of it scrolls, down to the button.
stage 1200 520
window 1200 520
prefer themeId aura-noir
prefer starAsked true
replies calls-tall.json
project storefront shop
chat Wren
title "Show the returns policy"
say "Add the returns policy to the checkout"
settle 8
front Wren
settle 2
click "Which returns policy should the checkout show?"
settle 2
snap calls-short
move 740,250
scroll -3000
settle 1
snap calls-short-end
